        <mxCell id="fe_body" value="• Operator screens: dashboard · form · uploads · resubmission · history&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Officer screens: queue · review · feedback · compare · audit&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• TanStack Query for server state; polls while documents verify&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• React Hook Form + Zod built from /form-schema&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• JWT in memory (+ sessionStorage for reloads); role only drives what is shown" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="300" width="310" height="340" as="geometry" />
